  "html": "<div id=\"step-9283\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\" stepid=\"9283\" steptype=\"example\" contentid=\"2766\">\n            <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                <div class=\"stepName\">\n                    Example: \n                    <a id=\"stepAnchor-9283\" class=\"stepAnchor\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\" name=\"step-8\">Identifying Nets That Do Not Correspond to a Particular Polyhedron</a> \n                </div>      \n                <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"9283\">?</div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                <div id=\"graphic-5ba4648e50bec56d5d548419d5eb8656\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/5ba4648e50bec56d5d548419d5eb8656\"></div> \n\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Which of the nets above is <strong>not</strong> the net of a pyramid?  </p>\n\n            </div>     \n\n            <div class=\"explanationHeader\">EXPLANATION</div>\n\n            <div class=\"exampleExplanation\">\n                <div id=\"graphic-ad825b7b52bd2b9fbabde5e353e78613\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/ad825b7b52bd2b9fbabde5e353e78613\"></div>     \n\n<p><br></p>\n<p>If we were to fold the net above along its edges, then we'd get a triangular prism, as shown below: </p>\n<p><br></p>\n<div id=\"graphic-5c6d5847c60b0abc3cf0e13c7c622a06\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/5c6d5847c60b0abc3cf0e13c7c622a06\"></div> \n\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Notice that the other two nets give us pyramids. Therefore,  the correct answer is I.</p>\n\n            </div>           \n        </div>",
